==Buy Phase==
===Match Start===
*{{AC|SkyeMatchStart1.mp3}} "Remember everyone, if we survive, woodworking class tonight in the mess hall. Nimble hands, nimble minds."
*{{AC|SkyeMatchStart2.mp3}} "Not used to working with humans. Usually just me and my pack. I guess it's worse if you guys get shot, yeah?"
*{{AC|SkyeMatchStart3.mp3}} "Okay, let's get going. This work won't take care of itself."
*{{AC|SkyeMatchStart5.mp3}} "Anyone I catch slacking off has to join my morning run tomorrow. Wake up's at four, sound good?"
*{{AC|SkyeMatchStart6.mp3}} "Everyone good if my pets run around out here? I don't do leashes. Should be alright."

====Attacking====
*{{AC|SkyeMatchStartAttack1.mp3}} "Game faces team, those defenders will make us work for it."
*{{AC|SkyeMatchStartAttack2.mp3}} "Let's get this spike down, and get the hell away from the blast. I'd rather not die to our own tech."

====Defending====
