*{{AC|SkyeRoundStart4.mp3}} "These parasites aren't gonna take one step past this place."
*{{AC|SkyeRoundStart6.mp3}} "Another fight? Clean slate! Let's leave whatever happened, in the past."
*{{AC|SkyeRoundStart7.mp3}} "We move as a unit, okay? Last thing I need is some hero messing things up."
*{{AC|SkyeRoundStart9.mp3}} "Make sure to follow my pack in. They'll lead us right to the enemy."
*{{AC|SkyeRoundStart10.mp3}} "We know what we're doing. Trust each other and we'll be fine."
*{{AC|SkyeRoundStart11.mp3}} "Don't sit down! We're not done yet."

